OL,3,GNEWSADouble-decker bus crashes into
OL,4,Abuilding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA double-decker bus has crashed into a
OL,7,Fbuilding.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,Fjunction of Station Road and Penryn
OL,11,FStreet, in Redruth, Cornwall, on
OL,12,FSaturday afternoon. A road was closed
OL,13,Fwhile emergency services attended.
OL,15,FDevon and Cornwall Police said there
OL,16,Fwere no reports of life-threatening or
OL,17,Flife-changing injuries. Cornwall Fire
OL,18,Fand Rescue Service said one appliance
OL,19,Ffrom Tolvaddon responded to the single
OL,20,Fvehicle crash at 12:25 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
