OL,3,GNEWSADouble-decker bus crashes into
OL,4,Abuilding
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said firefighters made the vehicle
OL,7,Fand scene safe. Ambulance crews also
OL,8,Fattended. The red bus could be seen
OL,9,Fwith its windows smashed.
